<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs unevenly steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs unevenly steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were unevenly steady. Demand was moderate on a moderate movement. Top $49.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  47.50-49.00 Few 49.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  42.00-47.50</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  37.00-42.00</p>
<p>Sows - mostly steady. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 40.00-44.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 43.00-46.00</p>
<p>		500-650 lbs. 46.00-50.00</p>
</text>
